@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<!-- Main content sections -->
<!-- Other sections -->
<section id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <h2 class="section-heading">About Student Debt Collective</h2>
                <p class="section-subheading text-muted">Conquer your student loan debt through collective effort.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <h3>Join the Collective</h3>
                <p>
                    Welcome to Student Debt Collective, where you can conquer your student loan debt through the power of
                    collective effort. Join our community and let's end the burden of student loans
                    together, one loan at a time.
                </p>
                <h3>How does it work?</h3>
                <p>
                    It's simple. By subscribing to our monthly newsletter for just $5 a month, you become part of a
                    crowdfunding model that pools together the collective strength of our subscribers. Each month, we'll send
                    a newsletter to subscribers with financial tips to help with the burdens of student loan debt. Along with
                    that, each month a lucky member will be randomly selected, and we will use the funds contributed by
                    all our subscribers to make a payment towards their student loan debt. It could be you!
                </p>
                <h3>Why choose Student Debt Collective?</h3>
                <p>
                    We believe in the strength of unity and the shared burden of our community. Together, we can make a
                    difference and overcome the challenges of student loan debt - together.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Join our community of like-minded individuals who understand the struggles associated with
                    student loan debt. By contributing to the collective, you not only help others but also increase your
                    chances of being selected for a debt payment. It's a win-win situation.
                </p>
                <p>
                    As part of the Student Debt Collective, you'll experience the power of philanthropy. By joining our
                    collective effort, you'll feel the satisfaction of giving while building a stronger community for yourself
                    and future generations. Together, we can create an environment of support, empathy, and progress.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We understand the importance of consistency. Once you commit to our cause, we are dedicated to delivering
                    helpful tools to help you on your journey to becoming debt-free. Our platform is built on the expertise and
                    experience of financial professionals who guide you towards financial freedom.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Be part of a growing movement. As more subscribers join and contribute, the impact of our collective
                    efforts becomes even more powerful. There is stregth in numbers, and together we can inspire others and
                    create positive and lasting change.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Don't miss out on this opportunity to take control of your student loan debt. The sooner you join, the
                    closer you get to becoming our next reward recipient. Your small monthly contribution can have a
                    significant impact on your debt and the lives of others.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Join the Student Debt Collective today by signing up for our newsletter. Stay informed, stay educated,
                    contribute to the collective, and increase your chances of being selected for a debt payment. It's time to
                    take charge of your financial future.
                </p>
                <p style="text-align:center;">
                    Together, we can overcome the burden of student loans and pave the way for a brighter future.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-3">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                <form id="about-newsletter-form" action="#" method="POST" class="mt-4">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-md-8 mb-3 mb-sm-0">
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-control"
                                       placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Subscribe</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="newsletter">
    <!-- Newsletter content -->
</section>

<section id="subscription">
    <!-- Subscription content -->
</section>

<section id="success-stories">
    <!-- Success Stories content -->
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <!-- Contact content -->
</section>
